Thanks to Sigmund Oerjavik (sigmund@solan.unit.no) I have found a way
to choke over a dead Wraith. I guess I have to correct myself. It
is quite complicated. Choking is done when ones food counter is above
a certain limit (2000 for what it is worth) and one wants to eat something,
despite the fact that the gained food points of this item is 0 (like it is
for Wraiths). Passing this food limit is only possible when eating a
large corpse (for example a dragon) while in normal state. The text
"You have a hard time getting it all down" appears on the topline.
Now ones foodcounter is probably passed beyond the deadly 2000 limit.
Eating a dead wraith will kill you. If however you are satiated and trying
to eat a large corpse, you'll be asked once whether or not to continue
eating. If you stop eating you also will be passed this 2000 limit.
If this question is not asked, it is save to eat the wraith corpses.
